    "detailed_description": "The world has frozen.<br>Explore a broken, fragmented universe to collect cards, customize your party, battle creatures, and find your friends to restore the world.<br>Silver Daze is a retro style coming-of-age JRPG filled with unique characters and thrilling battles!<br><br><strong>Traverse strange and colorful environments</strong> as you uncover the mystery of what has happened to your world!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912770/extras/ce2f3b08c0d952d3214e3206e36dc72c.avif?t=1754378946\" width=600 height=240 /></span><br><br><strong>Collect hundreds of cards</strong> by exploring, shopping, and defeating monsters!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912770/extras/f209ab38f5d423d424563d5ef33c2bd0.avif?t=1754378946\" width=600 height=240 /></span><br><br><strong>Master deep turn based combat</strong> by selecting your favorite cards and developing new strategies!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912770/extras/de5d0417edc92d48ce8f5a7fed13da0c.poster.avif?t=1754378946\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912770/extras/de5d0417edc92d48ce8f5a7fed13da0c.webm?t=1754378946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912770/extras/de5d0417edc92d48ce8f5a7fed13da0c.mp4?t=1754378946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Find your friends</strong>  and team up to save the world!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912770/extras/1584516734c71c1cfcee921de0b1094f.poster.avif?t=1754378946\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912770/extras/1584516734c71c1cfcee921de0b1094f.gif?t=1754378946\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br><br><strong>Get to know a vibrant cast of characters</strong> as they deal with emotional struggles at a turning point in their lives!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912770/extras/f2bf976ec477e0b825c01f4e06560e47.poster.avif?t=1754378946\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912770/extras/f2bf976ec477e0b825c01f4e06560e47.gif?t=1754378946\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br><br><br><br>Logo and Steam Promotional Artwork created by Cleiton Ven\u00e2ncio<br><br>Other promotional images created by Sawyer Friend and Bailey Barnes",
    "about_the_game": "The world has frozen.<br>Explore a broken, fragmented universe to collect cards, customize your party, battle creatures, and find your friends to restore the world.<br>Silver Daze is a retro style coming-of-age JRPG filled with unique characters and thrilling battles!<br><br><strong>Traverse strange and colorful environments</strong> as you uncover the mystery of what has happened to your world!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912770/extras/ce2f3b08c0d952d3214e3206e36dc72c.avif?t=1754378946\" width=600 height=240 /></span><br><br><strong>Collect hundreds of cards</strong> by exploring, shopping, and defeating monsters!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912770/extras/f209ab38f5d423d424563d5ef33c2bd0.avif?t=1754378946\" width=600 height=240 /></span><br><br><strong>Master deep turn based combat</strong> by selecting your favorite cards and developing new strategies!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912770/extras/de5d0417edc92d48ce8f5a7fed13da0c.poster.avif?t=1754378946\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912770/extras/de5d0417edc92d48ce8f5a7fed13da0c.webm?t=1754378946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912770/extras/de5d0417edc92d48ce8f5a7fed13da0c.mp4?t=1754378946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Find your friends</strong>  and team up to save the world!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912770/extras/1584516734c71c1cfcee921de0b1094f.poster.avif?t=1754378946\" media=\"(prefers-re